# Copy to /etc/mmh-virtual/fail2ban-ignoreip.conf (mode 0640, root:root).
# One IPv4/IPv6 or CIDR per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Used by scripts/install-fail2ban-meta-production.sh when rebuilding jail ignoreip.
#
# Examples (replace with your addresses — do not commit real public IPs to git):
# 203.0.113.10
# 198.51.100.0/24
# 2001:db8::/48